.resources/TASK-260715-1ozsb6/TASK-260715-1ozsb6_results.md-7-- Closed the round-11 Ed25519 evidence gap with a live loopback OpenSSH test using an in-memory `Curve25519.Signing.PrivateKey` behind `SSHPublicKeyCredential`. The test records a real opaque external-signer callback invocation, proves host policy precedes credential lookup, uses only `keychain.fixture.ed25519` as the secret reference, exercises exec, and restores the complete owned-resource snapshot to zero.
