.resources/TASK-260715-1ozsb6/TASK-260715-1ozsb6_review-results-06.md-13-Required rework: use bounded caller detachment plus explicit owned-task/cancellation lifecycle for every injected async seam, or provide another contract-valid mechanism that guarantees the operation deadline and transport-close deadline without abandoning adapter-owned tasks. Add a deterministic dependency that ignores task cancellation until an explicit release, prove the operation returns at its deadline before release, then prove close/release reconciles the task/resource baseline. Cover upload and at least one pre-session connect seam.
