.resources/TASK-260715-1ozsb6/TASK-260715-1ozsb6_third-public-api-blocker.md-112-   protocol invariant or cap.
.resources/TASK-260715-1ozsb6/TASK-260715-1ozsb6_third-public-api-blocker.md:113:2. Avoid reads near libssh2's threshold. This eventually deadlocks or requires
.resources/TASK-260715-1ozsb6/TASK-260715-1ozsb6_third-public-api-blocker.md-114-   deliberately never delivering pending data; it does not provide consumer
.resources/TASK-260715-1ozsb6/TASK-260715-1ozsb6_third-public-api-blocker.md-115-   semantics.
.resources/TASK-260715-1ozsb6/TASK-260715-1ozsb6_third-public-api-blocker.md:116:3. Parse `libssh2_session_last_error` strings to recover channel-open reasons.
.resources/TASK-260715-1ozsb6/TASK-260715-1ozsb6_third-public-api-blocker.md-117-   Diagnostic prose is not a stable typed API and may change or be localized.
.resources/TASK-260715-1ozsb6/TASK-260715-1ozsb6_third-public-api-blocker.md-118-4. Interpret exit status `0` as always reported or always absent. Either choice
--
