blocked by 2ny6z4, blocks 1af33i/1ozsb6/2d3g5e); no product code touched (doc-only as required); board validates clean; logbook entry recorded. Tests-green interpreted as doc-task analog: board validation + PlantUML syntax + hash checks pass. No gaps found; ADR-014 remains open as required.
